>> [duplicate]: reference

> These freeze well. Double the batch and freeze half for a quick weeknight dinner.

= Filling

Cook @rice{200%g} according to [- todo: add garlic rice recipe -] package directions.

Sauté @onion{1/2}(diced) and @garlic{2-3 cloves}(minced) in @olive oil{2%tbsp}
in a #large skillet{} until softened, about ~fry{5 minutes}.

Add @canned tomatoes{400%g}, @black beans{240%g}(drained),
@cumin{1%tsp}, and @smoked paprika{1%tsp}. Stir in the @&(1)cooked rice{}.

-- perhaps add sauce section here later?

= Assembly -- needs some work

Cut the tops off @peppers|capsicum{4} and remove seeds.
Stuff with the @&(=1)filling and place in a #baking dish{}.

> An aged cheddar is recommended.

Top each pepper with @cheese|cheddar{100%g}(grated) and optionally @?pecorino{50%g}(shaved).

Bake in a preheated #oven at 190°C for ~{30 minutes} until @&peppers.
are tender and @&cheese is bubbling.

Serve with @@./Sauces/Salsa Verde{1-1.5 servings}. -- todo

